    "body": "- `TestDisaggregationMooncakeFailure` sends 64 concurrent `/generate` requests directly instead of running a 200-example gsm8k eval. The injected failure is rolled on every poll, so nearly every request fails, and the eval client retried each one six times with exponential backoff: about 145s of waiting per run.\n- The test now always checks that both prefill and decode are alive and pass `/health_generate`; before, it checked only when the eval raised. A hung request now fails the test after 120s.\n- Lower `est_time` from 1007 to 870.\n\nNo behavior change outside the test.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:no_entry_sign: [Run #38206551243](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38206551243)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38206550813](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38206550813)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:hourglass_flowing_sand: [Run #38206551200](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38206551200)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
